templateVersions.content:
Write a plain-language narrative of a single agent decision for a compliance reader, using only the recorded facts below.

Decision: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Headline__c}
Agent: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Agent_API_Name__c} (version {!$Input:TargetDecision.Agent_Version__c})
Occurred: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Occurred_At__c}
Outcome: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Outcome__c}
Autonomy: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Autonomy_Level__c}
Consequence: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Consequence_Level__c}
What it did: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Actions_Taken__c}
What it read: {!$Input:TargetDecision.Sources_Read__c}

Additional context:
{!$Input:AdditionalContext}

Rules:
- Separate Observed facts from the Declared rationale. Never present the declared rationale as a computation trace.
- Do not invent actions, sources, approvals or reasoning that are not in the fields above.
- If the rationale was captured after the action rather than before, say so plainly.
- Keep it to a short factual paragraph an auditor can trust.
